Media
Manga
Written and illustrated by Makoto Kudo, My Awkward Senpai initially began as a webcomic published on Kudo's Twitter account published on March 2, 2019. It was later serialized in Square Enix's  manga magazine Young Gangan from December 6, 2019, to February 6, 2026. Its chapters have been collected into eleven  volumes released from March 25, 2020, to February 25, 2026. The series is published in English by Comikey and by Square Enix through their Manga UP! Global app.
